[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4582094847","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119891#issuecomment-4582094847","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119891","id":4582094847,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABER03_w","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-30T07:30:10Z","updated_at":"2026-05-30T07:30:10Z","body":"Hi, please note that embedded games follow the editor's platform preference, while exported games depend exclusively on the `display/display_server/driver.linuxbsd` advanced project setting. This is necessary as each display driver has its own different embedding technology which aren't mutually compatible (e.g. Wayland can't automatically embed X11 windows and viceversa).\n\nFrom your description I guess that you haven't set it. I wouldn't be surprised as it's somewhat hidden unfortunately 😅\n\nAnother way to confirm this is either unsetting the `DISPLAY` environment variable while running the game (which will fallback to Wayland) or use the `--display-driver wayland` command line argument.\n\nThe rationale behind this oddity is that the Wayland driver is still experimental and opt-in, and the two options are there so that for example developers can have a native but less tested experience, while shipping with the more tested X11 backend.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4582094847/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4582275487","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119891#issuecomment-4582275487","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119891","id":4582275487,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABER_5nw","user":{"login":"Birdulon","id":5397662,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzOTc2NjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5397662?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Birdulon","html_url":"https://github.com/Birdulon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Birdulon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Birdulon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Birdulon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Birdulon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Birdulon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Birdulon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Birdulon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Birdulon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Birdulon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-30T08:29:50Z","updated_at":"2026-05-30T08:29:50Z","body":"That was the problem, thank you so much! I'd been running `godot/bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64` and didn't consider that there was also `godot/bin/godot.x11.tools.64` and that it might launch with a different display server to the editor.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4582275487/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]